<title>JAPAN: Japan 6-yr bond auction lowest price 100.19.</title>
<headline>Japan 6-yr bond auction lowest price 100.19.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The auction of 400 billion yen in 1.9 percent six-year government bonds produced the following results, the Ministry of Finance said on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Lowest price	 100.19    Stop rate	   1.864 pct</p>
<p>Average price	100.22    Average yield     1.857 pct</p>
<p>Total bids	   1.2923 trillion yen</p>
<p>Accepted Bids	399.6 billion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 42.4778 pct</p>
<p>Issue date    July 22, 1997   Maturity    July 22, 2003</p>
<p>Coupon payment     Jan 20, July 20</p>
</text>
